# Lash Zone AI Receptionist

24/7 AI-powered phone receptionist for beauty and lash studios.

## Features

- **AI Voice Receptionist**: Natural conversations with clients using GPT-4o
- **24/7 Availability**: Never miss a call, even outside business hours
- **Booking Assistance**: Help clients book appointments and send booking links
- **FAQ Management**: Configure what information Luna can provide
- **SMS Integration**: Send booking links and notifications via SMS
- **Escalation Handling**: Automatically alert management for sensitive matters
- **Call Recording & Transcript**: Review all conversations
- **Admin Dashboard**: Manage settings, FAQs, and view call history

## Quick Start

### 1. Backend Setup

```bash
cd backend
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate  # On Windows: venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your API keys
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000
```

### 2. Database Setup

Run the SQL schema in Supabase:
```bash
# Copy and run database/schema.sql in Supabase SQL Editor
```

### 3. Frontend Setup

```bash
cd frontend/lash-zone-admin
pnpm install
cp .env.example .env
pnpm dev
```

### 4. Twilio Configuration

Set your Twilio webhook URL to:
```
https://your-domain.com/webhook/incoming-call
```

