├── frontend/
│   └── lash-zone-admin/             # React admin dashboard
│       └── src/
│           ├── pages/               # Dashboard pages
│           ├── components/          # Shared components
│           └── lib/api.ts           # API client
├── SPEC.md                          # Project specification
└── README.md
```

## Configuration

### Environment Variables

| Variable | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID` | Twilio account SID |
| `TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN` | Twilio auth token |
| `TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER` | Twilio phone number |
| `OPENAI_API_KEY` | OpenAI API key |
| `SUPABASE_URL` | Supabase project URL |
| `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` | Supabase anon key |
| `SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY` | Supabase service key |
| `STUDIO_NAME` | Your business name |
| `STUDIO_PHONE` | Your business phone |
| `OWNER_PHONE` | Management phone for escalations |
| `BOOKING_URL` | Online booking URL |
| `BASE_URL` | Your production URL |

## AI Personality

The AI receptionist (Luna) is configured to:

- Answer in a warm, professional, friendly tone
- Sound like an experienced salon receptionist
- Handle bookings, FAQs, and general inquiries
- Escalate complaints, refund requests, and allergic reactions
- Send SMS booking links when appropriate
- Encourage clients to book appointments

## Deployment

### Backend (Railway/Render/Fly.io)

1. Push code to GitHub
2. Connect to deployment platform
3. Set environment variables
4. Deploy

### Frontend (Vercel/Netlify)

1. Build: `cd frontend/lash-zone-admin && pnpm build`
2. Deploy the `dist` folder

### Domain & SSL

Configure your domain and ensure HTTPS is enabled for Twilio webhooks.

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/webhook/incoming-call` | Twilio incoming call webhook |
| POST | `/webhook/call-status` | Call status updates |
| GET | `/api/calls` | List call history |
| GET | `/api/calls/{id}` | Call details |
| GET | `/api/appointments` | List appointments |
| POST | `/api/appointments` | Create appointment |
| GET | `/api/escalations` | List escalations |
| GET | `/api/faqs` | List FAQs |
| POST | `/api/faqs` | Create FAQ |
| GET | `/api/config` | Get configuration |
| PUT | `/api/config` | Update configuration |
| POST | `/api/sms/send` | Send SMS |

